# Mog House Exposition, section 1 in Bastok Markets and Port Bastok (Bastok Mines is the main flow): a char of nation 1
# (a GM's notSeen 1 before each entry: charCreate writes it): in the home nation's Mog House the zone-in 30000 (the
# zoneline finishes it with 0): quest:complete (the vars cleared), oNation 1.
# `zoneline <Zone>` is the zone's Mog House line.
lists BastokMarkets/onZoneIn/1 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/30000 PortBastok/onZoneIn/1 PortBastok/onEventFinish/30000
char zone=BastokMines pos=116.9,-1.6,-72 job=WAR lvl=1 nation=1
login
warp -98.9,-4.8,-77.5 BastokMarkets
charvar HQuest[moghouseExpo]notSeen 1  # a GM
zoneline BastokMarkets           # the home Mog House: 30000 (finished with 0): complete; oNation 1
warp -3,1.407,49 PortBastok
charvar HQuest[moghouseExpo]notSeen 1  # a GM
zoneline PortBastok              # the home Mog House: 30000 (finished with 0): complete; oNation 1
